{{!
    @template format_dari/page_data
    @copyright  2026 Dari Learning
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    A hidden element carrying JSON for an AMD module, read with element.dataset.json.

    Used where the data is too large for a js_call_amd() argument (Moodle warns past 1KB). The
    value is an attribute, escaped by Mustache, so nothing in it can break out of the element.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * id string The element id the module looks for.
    * json string JSON-encoded data.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "id": "dari-player-config",
        "json": "{\"courseid\": 2}"
    }
}}
<div id="{{id}}" hidden data-json="{{json}}"></div>
